\newlabel{fig:diagram_heatmaps}{{4}{17}{Board-level view of defender structure and attacker behavior. Left: marginal occupancy heatmaps for scripted defender families. Right: first-five-shot frequencies from a scripted posterior-search attacker under the corresponding defender family. The figure illustrates both first-order structure and attacker adaptation, while the paper's defender metrics capture higher-order geometric effects that per-cell marginals alone do not determine}{figure.caption.8}{}}
